post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
MyMan is installed. Each person who uses it runs, once, as themselves:
  myman-setup
That creates ~/MyManBrain and ~/.config/myman/agents.json with every agent
permission off. Turn on only what you want your agents to use.
On Omarchy, add the "show my agents" key (SUPER+SHIFT+PRINT) and a MyMan menu:
  myman omarchy install
Check everything with: myman doctor
MSG
}
post_upgrade() {
  echo 'MyMan updated. Your Brain and agent permissions were not changed.'
}
